<title>SWITZERLAND: Rieter works with Estonia's Mistra-Autex.</title>
<headline>Rieter works with Estonia's Mistra-Autex.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rieter Holding AG unit Rieter Automotive Systems said it had agreed a licensing and cooperation agreement with Estonia's  Mistra-Autex A/S to develop and produce vehicle carpets.</p>
<p>&quot;Mistra-Autex will act as a supplier partner to Rieter Automotive Systems, mainly in the North and East European markets,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Mistra-Autex, which now supplies non-woven carpets to Russian auto producers, employes 140 people and has annual turnover of around 10 million Swiss francs, it said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
